.IX Title "Lucy::Search::PolyQuery 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::PolyQuery 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::PolyQuery \- Base class for composite Query objects.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 12
\&    sub walk {
\&        my $query = shift;
\&        if ( $query\->isa("Lucy::Search::PolyQuery") ) {
\&            if    ( $query\->isa("Lucy::Search::ORQuery") )  { ... }
\&            elsif ( $query\->isa("Lucy::Search::ANDQuery") ) { ... }
\&            elsif ( $query\->isa("Lucy::Search::RequiredOptionalQuery") ) {
\&                ...
\&            }
\&            elsif ( $query\->isa("Lucy::Search::NOTQuery") ) { ... }
\&        }
\&        else { ... }
\&    }
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
PolyQuery serves as a shared base class for
ANDQuery,
ORQuery,
NOTQuery, and
RequiredOptionalQuery.  All of
these classes may serve as nodes in composite Query with a tree structure
which may be walked.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS add_child
.IX Subsection "add_child"
.Vb 1
\&    $poly_query\->add_child($query);
.Ve
.PP
Add a child Query node.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::PolyQuery isa Lucy::Search::Query isa Clownfish::Obj.
